{"cache_key":"befa55cd78e9193a6cfec90569562044b905756cbcdf2bf8de6911a0e2bf764f","segment_id":"adminConfirm","source_path":"extensions/openclaw-id-access/browser/i18n/locales/en.ts","src_lang":"en","text":"The {role} role has administrator access. Administrators can change Gateway settings, manage devices and approvals, and access connected services. Only invite someone you trust with this claw.","text_hash":"501a577307b56c02c57b6fb3404de13413347715afff76eb67510e60bb222d4c","tgt_lang":"id","translated":"Peran {role} memiliki akses administrator. Administrator dapat mengubah pengaturan Gateway, mengelola perangkat dan persetujuan, serta mengakses layanan yang terhubung. Hanya undang orang yang Anda percayai untuk mengelola claw ini.","updated_at":"2026-11-16T09:21:04.604Z"}
